970000248,1981,97104811,Mr. President. I thank the Chair. Mr. President. I wish to commend the distinguished occupant of the chair. I believe he is the first Republican to grace that position following on after the election of the Republican majority. and following on after the election of a Republican President pro tempore of the Senate. So I congratulate him for that signal honor. I am awaiting the arrival on the floor of the distinguished minority leader. and while we are doing that I suggest the absence of a quorum.,mr president i thank the chair mr president i wish to commend the distinguished occupant of the chair i believe he is the first republican to grace that position following on after the election of the republican majority and following on after the election of a republican president pro tempore of the senate so i congratulate him for that signal honor i am awaiting the arrival on the floor of the distinguished minority leader and while we are doing that i suggest the absence of a quorum,1980s
