current resolution and that when the senate recesses on friday january 20 1989 pursuant to a motion made by the majority leader or his designee in accordance with this resolution it stand in recess until 12 oclock noon on wednesday january 25 szc 2 the speaker of the house and the majority leader of the senate acting jointly after consultation with the minority leader of the house and the minority leader of the senate shall notify the members of the house and the senate respectively to reassemble whenever in their opinion the public interest shall warrant it,1980s
